  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended), prior approval would be required and REFUSED for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe proposed single storey rear extension is refused in accordance with Town and Country Planning (GPDO) 2015 (as amended) Class A, A.4(7) as the impact of the proposed development on the amenity of adjoining neighbours is considered to be materially harmful and unacceptable. The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its scale, bulk, form and massing, would be overbearing, unduly dominant and visually intrusive, resulting in an unacceptable loss of daylight, outlook and increased sense of enclosure toward the adjoining/adjacent property no.37 Hazelwood Avenue, Morden. Additionally, the proposal would be contrary to policies D12.3 and D12.4 of Merton Local Plan 2024.\r\n"
